# Build artifacts - never transfer these, they regenerate
bin/
obj/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Unity - regenerated on first open, and enormous
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.unityproj

# ...but the hand-written test project must travel, or the C# core suite
# can't run on a fresh clone.
!unity/tests/CoreTests/CoreTests.csproj

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local
*.log

# Bot factory: the run ledger is a local artifact — 30k lines of candidate
# hashes, needed only to `--resume` the run that produced it. The committed
# record of a run is bots/REPORT.md and bots/state/LOOP_LOG.md, which carry the
# trial counts the standard of proof depends on. A fresh clone starts a fresh
# ledger, which is correct: a new search's luck bar should reflect that search.
bots/state/run_state.json
# ... and any alternate ledger, e.g. a search run against a decay rung
bots/state/fast_*.json
bots/state/hibar.json
bots/state/*.prev
bots/state/*.tmp
